      "widgets_values": [
        "Replace only the inner facial identity of the adult man in image 1 with the face from image 2. Transfer the donor man's broad oval facial structure, deep-brown eyes, wider nose bridge, full lips, rounded jaw, cheek contours, and recognizable adult facial proportions. Fit the new identity naturally inside the existing face position and match image 1's age texture and skin lighting.\n\nStrictly preserve image 1's swept-back light-auburn hair streaked with gray, exact hairline, ears, neck, forest-green wool signal-keeper jacket, cream shirt, shoulders, body pose, vintage timber-and-brass railway signal cabin, rain-streaked blue-hour windows, camera angle, crop, warm tungsten key light, and cool window fill. Do not transfer the donor's close-cropped coiled hair, dark jacket, or studio background. Do not change anything outside the inner face region.",
